already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T11:01:33-07:00","id":1522169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522166#post1522166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think so myself, but they may not put as much focus on it like VTM and original wod.</div> </div> </div> </div>A glance at the larger picture demonstrates they are strangulating it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T11:03:05-07:00","id":1522170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522169#post1522169\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A glance at the larger picture demonstrates they are strangulating it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is not good as I still like VTR, Changeling The Lost &amp; Mage The Awakening a great deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T14:09:46-07:00","id":1522180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522170#post1522170\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is not good as I still like VTR, Changeling The Lost &amp; Mage The Awakening a great deal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love mage, I would personally love to have enough money to either buy the IP from Paradox and make it something like open source style (with a fan committee) to stir the developments. Or the same way that Kickstarter has funded the projects have a constant revenue stream from those of us that love the Chronicles and dont have money to pay ALL books of ALL gamelines, but would love to add to a pot that helps our favourite gamelines.<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading my rant, I really hate living in a place where my currency is not really worth much in USD / EUR, and hate not being able to support more people like Dave Brookshaw and the many other amazing writers working for the gamelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T14:16:30-07:00","id":1522181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522180#post1522180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I love mage, I would personally love to have enough money to either buy the IP from Paradox and make it something like open source style (with a fan committee) to stir the developments. Or the same way that Kickstarter has funded the projects have a constant revenue stream from those of us that love the Chronicles and dont have money to pay ALL books of ALL gamelines, but would love to add to a pot that helps our favourite gamelines.<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading my rant, I really hate living in a place where my currency is not really worth much in USD / EUR, and hate not being able to support more people like Dave Brookshaw and the many other amazing writers working for the gamelines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Open source would be the absolute death of Chronicles, not it's revival. But otherwise, producers who actually give a shit about the gameline would be nice, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T16:46:44-07:00","id":1522188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522181#post1522181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Open source would be the absolute death of Chronicles, not it's revival. But otherwise, producers who actually give a shit about the gameline would be nice, yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>If only they were as passionate as you freelance writers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T17:19:50-07:00","id":1522192,"title":"","content":"Creative types are a passionate lot and I don't see it as a negative as some entertainment companies seem to try to paint for the media.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-06T17:58:05-07:00","id":1522196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522181#post1522181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Open source would be the absolute death of Chronicles, not it's revival. But otherwise, producers who actually give a shit about the gameline would be nice, yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, I was just daydreaming... IF I was rich enough to buy the IP, probably I would pay for set-in-stone changes to the setting, and still would treat it as business to get some profit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T00:55:10-07:00","id":1522205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1522180#post1522180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I love mage, I would personally love to have enough money to either buy the IP from Paradox and make it something like open source style (with a fan committee) to stir the developments. Or the same way that Kickstarter has funded the projects have a constant revenue stream from those of us that love the Chronicles and dont have money to pay ALL books of ALL gamelines, but would love to add to a pot that helps our favourite gamelines.<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading my rant, I really hate living in a place where my currency is not really worth much in USD / EUR, and hate not being able to support more people like Dave Brookshaw and the many other amazing writers working for the gamelines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you familiar with the history of Pathfinder?<br /> <br /> They used the Open Game License to publish an entire RPG based on DnD 3.5<br /> <br /> (Dubbed 3.75 by some in the community).<br /> <br /> I would go even further an state that IP protection has its limits, and a lot of the ideas contained in Chronicles are public domain, thus not covered. While the rules themselves are not protected at all (you need a patent to protect ideas as opposed to copyright-able 'expressions', and patenting game ideas has so few examples where it actually stood up, the &quot;tapping&quot; mechanic from magic the gathering being the main one that comes to mind).<br /> <br /> So the main thing any fan project would need to avoid is trademarks (which do offer a very broad protection, and are also the most specific, designed to avoid customer confusion... ).<br /> <br /> All that said, Paradox are better off offering an Open Game License (or equivalent), and maybe they do via the Storyteller Vault. I am not sure if one would be better off financially breaking away and writing your own game system, vs going the Storyteller Vault and supporting a game which the IP holder seems to have no interest in.<br /> <br /> If you live in a country where your currency is undervalued, then you also (likely) have less reason to fear being sued.<br /> <br /> Lastly if Mage in particular is what you are interested in, i would suggest looking at Ars Magica, given that it was in some ways an inspiration for the original Mage (the Ascension) game, it gives a good idea of how similar a game can be without infringement on the IP of the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27248,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","user":"orathaic","date":". 09-10-2023, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T14:04:33-07:00","id":1522231,"title":"","content":"I have heard of the game PathFinder Orathaic , but I'm really digging the StarFinder series right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T14:16:03-07:00","id":1523438,"title":"","content":"It doesn't need to be Open Source, but they can give away artless productions for free to draw in as many people as possible. I mean, look at the most popular RPGs like Kevin Crawford's Stars Without Number, Mork Borg with the free Barebones Edition, Ironsworn, etc. They contain the FULL rules for free, just without arts. They rake in so many people buying actual products after trying them out for free. But I think that's what they're trying to do with the Storypath Ultra right now, but not sure if it's taking off since there's no marketing or advertising anywhere (so far I've seen.) Demos and Quickstarts don't really count since most contents are cut from the main splatbooks. I honestly think they should have done this with Chronicles of Darkness before Paradox came along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25803,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25803-omichli","user":"Omichli","date":". 10-01-2023, 05:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25803-omichli","name":"Omichli","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-01T20:27:17-07:00","id":1523450,"title":"","content":"It's not as simple as that (also why would CCP have done it either?). What works for indie games that are meant to be single book RPGs that maybe get a few supplements if enough people throw money at the creator, isn't what works for a game that's meant to have over a dozen core books, and then dozens of supplements to each of those, as a baked in part of its business model. <br /> <br /> Even Storypath Ultra isn't some sort of SRD for all of the games built on it. Each Storypath game takes that foundation and tweaks it heavily to the different design goals. A no-art simple version of the Storyath Ultra rules is never going to be a replacement for buying the actual games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-02T13:23:45-07:00","id":1523472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1521556#post1521556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's good, None More Dark is genuinely professional level</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a reason for that. Several of us are (were?) CofD freelanders before Paradox ghosted the brand and Sam does not skimp on art or layout. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-02T15:02:06-07:00","id":1523475,"title":"","content":"If Onyx Path was to go with the free sample method (and I\u2019m not saying they should) I think it could work if they offered the basic human system as the freebie keeping the other stuff back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T21:38:35-07:00","id":1523597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1523475#post1523475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Onyx Path was to go with the free sample method (and I\u2019m not saying they should) I think it could work if they offered the basic human system as the freebie keeping the other stuff back.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've already done this via the GMC Rules Update and the Haunting of Hill Manor supplements. About the only thing they could do more is re-release the latter as &quot;Chronicles of Darkness: Mortal Investigators Version&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-08T17:18:13-07:00","id":1523843,"title":"","content":"That still requires you to have an account with drivethru, the more people a free sample can catch the better.<br /> I could be entirely wrong about this since I\u2019m not in the industry but I feel that the fewer steps someone has to click through before they are reading a how to play guide the better it would work out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-09T04:48:11-07:00","id":1523871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1523843#post1523843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That still requires you to have an account with drivethru, the more people a free sample can catch the better.<br /> I could be entirely wrong about this since I\u2019m not in the industry but I feel that the fewer steps someone has to click through before they are reading a how to play guide the better it would work out.</div> </div> </div> </div>If someone is unwilling to make an account with a well known retailer of a product in order to get a free sample of that product they're probably not all that interested in the product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-09T11:09:04-07:00","id":1523881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1523843#post1523843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That still requires you to have an account with drivethru, the more people a free sample can catch the better.<br /> I could be entirely wrong about this since I\u2019m not in the industry but I feel that the fewer steps someone has to click through before they are reading a how to play guide the better it would work out.</div> </div> </div> </div>While you actually have a point, it's overridden by what Cat pointed out, and the fact that on the internet, a lot of people feel more secure about free downloads if there is a little more work in doing it that vibes with their idea of security.<br /> <br /> People have been at the game of promotion in the digital age for over two decades now. We're at a point where if you see something &quot;obvious&quot; and you're wondering why no one's doing it, it's time to apply to CHesterton's Fence rather than assume no one thought of it before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-10T01:42:31-07:00","id":1523905,"title":"","content":"Fair point, I had an image in my head of being able to just post a link to a get started guide to try and persuade people to give CofD a try but I guess I can do the same now I know about that free sample game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-04T22:53:33-08:00","id":1531997,"title":"","content":"I think they will primarily focus on WOD5 now and for a longer time. We will only get a few remaining releases for CofD, like &quot;The Hedge.&quot;<br /> <br /> However, I also got the impression that they might silently prepare a CofD 3rd Edition, which would start in a few years after WOD5 is mainly done.<br /> A CofD 3rd Edition would most likely be based on the new StoryPath system (Ultra) and incorporate many ideas that evolved over the years.<br /> So, that would mean the start of a profoundly overhauled CofD line.<br /> Well, at least we can hope. <br /> <br /> I do not see any other reasonable option for now. If they abandon CofD, that would be a disaster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28392-henlikuoth","name":"Henlikuoth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T01:10:39-08:00","id":1531999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henlikuoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1531997#post1531997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think they will primarily focus on WOD5 now and for a longer time. We will only get a few remaining releases for CofD, like &quot;The Hedge.&quot;<br /> <br /> However, I also got the impression that they might silently prepare a CofD 3rd Edition, which would start in a few years after WOD5 is mainly done.<br /> A CofD 3rd Edition would most likely be based on the new StoryPath system (Ultra) and incorporate many ideas that evolved over the years.<br /> So, that would mean the start of a profoundly overhauled CofD line.<br /> Well, at least we can hope.<br /> <br /> I do not see any other reasonable option for now. If they abandon CofD, that would be a disaster.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That isn't really gonna happen seeing as onyxpath hasn't really worked on ant WOD5 books save extra vampire books for V5 beyond that not much else.<br /> <br /> As for CodD 3e also never going to happen specifically with Storypath ultra seeing as its onyxpath in house system and Cofd isn't really owned by onyxpath but is liscensed by paradox who owns the rights towards world of darkness and chronicle of darkness. <br /> <br /> Though it's important to note onyxpath is working on something that kinda cofdish called curseborne. They did a live play test of it a while ago and are also doing an internet ARG with hints of a Kickstarter that may be coming at some point.<br /> <br /> But yeah cofd is slowly getting sunsetted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T08:09:32-08:00","id":1532031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henlikuoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1531997#post1531997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do not see any other reasonable option for now. If they abandon CofD, that would be a disaster.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunatley, I think that's exactly what is happening. But I was talking with another freelancer a few weeks ago and he quite sagely pointed out that WoD went through this cycle too and it came back. While it is beyond disappointing that Paradox has ghosted the CofD fanbase, it is not the end. <br /> <br /> In the meanwhile, there's these forums, there's Discord, there's Tumblr, and there's the Storyteller's Vault.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T23:26:19-08:00","id":1532072,"title":"","content":"Well, in that case, at least we can look back to a rich publication history in CofD. We can still use the books/materials for years and decades.<br /> Still sad, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28392-henlikuoth","name":"Henlikuoth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-09T03:19:38-08:00","id":1532279,"title":"","content":"Did CofD have a &quot;Days of Judgment&quot; or &quot;Final Judgment&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-09T03:26:59-08:00","id":1532282,"title":"","content":"I guess you could argue that the Contagion Chronicle is like that. But &quot;Day of Judgment&quot; or books like that wouldn't really fit with Chronicle of Darkness, maybe something like World of Darkness Mirror for 1st edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-09T04:12:42-08:00","id":1532283,"title":"","content":"There's nothing like the Time of Judgement for CofD, because it was a way to run various decade long plot lines that the WoD had. There's no massive plot lines to resolve, and no years of build up to a specific cross-game end-times event that was going on over the course of lots of books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T15:37:29-07:00","id":1532397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532282#post1532282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess you could argue that the Contagion Chronicle is like that. But &quot;Day of Judgment&quot; or books like that wouldn't really fit with Chronicle of Darkness, maybe something like World of Darkness Mirror for 1st edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of which, how does this contagion work? I saw one thing or another, but I never really understood, is it something like the pandemic or a supernatural virus?","signature":