lass=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532398#post1532398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a problem within the God Machine. But after it hits it can behave like a virus or anything else really.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought it was a phenomena the God machine tries to keep out, which is why it can have multiple vector points. It's extremely disappointing if it's just God Machine broke phenomena","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T16:36:53-07:00","id":1532402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532398#post1532398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a problem within the God Machine. But after it hits it can behave like a virus or anything else really.</div> </div> </div> </div>I already knew this part, I wanted to know how this contagion works and how it acts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T18:06:58-07:00","id":1532406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532402#post1532402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I already knew this part, I wanted to know how this contagion works and how it acts.</div> </div> </div> </div>It varies by contagion. One contagion is making ghosts manifest in the physical world and another is making people suicidal. There's no single unifying item between all the contagions that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T18:23:19-07:00","id":1532407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532406#post1532406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It varies by contagion. One contagion is making ghosts manifest in the physical world and another is making people suicidal. There's no single unifying item between all the contagions that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>So can be literally anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T18:57:34-07:00","id":1532411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532397#post1532397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of which, how does this contagion work? I saw one thing or another, but I never really understood, is it something like the pandemic or a supernatural virus?</div> </div> </div> </div>The God-Machine's ultimate nature is a mystery, but the things it's plugged into and the way the fiction tends to paint it indicate that part of its occult medium works on the bit of ordered reality that allows things to make sense to a human frame of reference. It's the &quot;neat little boxes&quot; in Beast's theme about &quot;no neat little boxes.&quot; It's the lowercase-lettered counterpart of how Mage's metaphysics deal with capital-lettered Forms and Instruments and the like.<br /> <br /> The Contagion is neat little boxes gone sideways. It's carefully-cultivated retroviruses occult breaching containment. Crucial distinctions between loosely related phenomena break down. Magical mutation spawns new strains of unreality that hop the divides between species, substance, or even time and distance. A traveling merchant could infect a landmark, which could in turn infect a flock of birds, which could develop some supernatural quality in photographs of them, which might then infect the web server they're stored in, which might echo back in time to the ground-breaking ceremony of the building the server is stored in, and so on throughout creation. Not for nothing is the Abyss another one of the existing cosmological elements that thematically resonates with the Contagion.<br /> <br /> The Contagion is occult weirdness that's, well, contagious. Individual outbreaks can spread in consistent ways, but the unpredictable core nature of the thing means there's always the chance that reality will throw you a curveball. It's theoretically possible to leverage it in ways that might ground out the risks of it getting out of hand, but part of the reason it serves (by study of how to combat its spread) as a basis for powers that every splat can use is because it doesn't have any sort of innate respect for the divisions between splats (or anything else, really).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T19:58:07-07:00","id":1532414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532411#post1532411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The God-Machine's ultimate nature is a mystery, but the things it's plugged into and the way the fiction tends to paint it indicate that part of its occult medium works on the bit of ordered reality that allows things to make sense to a human frame of reference. It's the &quot;neat little boxes&quot; in Beast's theme about &quot;no neat little boxes.&quot; It's the lowercase-lettered counterpart of how Mage's metaphysics deal with capital-lettered Forms and Instruments and the like.<br /> <br /> The Contagion is neat little boxes gone sideways. It's carefully-cultivated retroviruses occult breaching containment. Crucial distinctions between loosely related phenomena break down. Magical mutation spawns new strains of unreality that hop the divides between species, substance, or even time and distance. A traveling merchant could infect a landmark, which could in turn infect a flock of birds, which could develop some supernatural quality in photographs of them, which might then infect the web server they're stored in, which might echo back in time to the ground-breaking ceremony of the building the server is stored in, and so on throughout creation. Not for nothing is the Abyss another one of the existing cosmological elements that thematically resonates with the Contagion.<br /> <br /> The Contagion is occult weirdness that's, well, contagious. Individual outbreaks can spread in consistent ways, but the unpredictable core nature of the thing means there's always the chance that reality will throw you a curveball. It's theoretically possible to leverage it in ways that might ground out the risks of it getting out of hand, but part of the reason it serves (by study of how to combat its spread) as a basis for powers that every splat can use is because it doesn't have any sort of innate respect for the divisions between splats (or anything else, really).</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, worse than that, I think you could make a &quot;Days of Judgment&quot; style story out of it, I'm not even kidding. There could be several sources of infection around the world, with different manifestations and each group of supernaturals would have to deal with it in a different way, even making unlikely alliances; They could also justify the existence of some species because of a contagion, vampires and mages would be the favorites I believe, and now they would have to deal with the fact that they are a mistake or that the end of the contagion would mark the end of their lives in the darkness, in the end all this would lead to a scenario of almost the end of the world and perhaps the darkness itself would retreat as a consequence. It's something to think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T20:31:40-07:00","id":1532418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1532407#post1532407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So can be literally anything?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. Literally anything. Generally there's things that can be destroyed and carriers that can be cured or killed to halt that particular strain, but even beaten strains have come back over time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T05:41:38-07:00","id":1533243,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Hedge&quot; was recently published. Was that the last publication for CofD? Or is there anything else still coming?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28392-henlikuoth","name":"Henlikuoth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-27T05:49:00-07:00","id":1