so rich that we can use it for decades.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, though I hope we see incremental releases. Promethean, mummy, and beast could really benefit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-28T02:59:47-07:00","id":1533305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Henlikuoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521532-is-chronicles-of-darkness-ending?p=1533265#post1533265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ok. I plan to get all the remaining titles to complete my CofD collection.<br /> <br /> It is a bit sad to see CofD coming to an end now. In my view, CofD still has much potential and room for more publications.<br /> Maybe we will see a wholly renewed 3rd edition of CofD in the far future. At least we can hope, but it might take many years.<br /> <br /> However, as mentioned above, the current CofD material is so rich that we can use it for decades.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't blame all the doom saying, but I'd wait and see what happens after they're released.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28417-fae_tail","name":"Fae_Tail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28417_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-28T10:15:46-07:00","id":1533316,"title":"","content":"I know the history of CofD, but I've also been around long enough to have seen a lot of series come and go and and I know how bad it feels, but I also know getting worked up isn't worth it, especially when Paradox is just ghosting everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28417-fae_tail","name":"Fae_Tail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28417_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-28T10:22:47-07:00","id":1533318,"title":"","content":"Don't get me wrong. I have nothing against Mummy, Deviant, etc., getting more books. I certainly hope that would be the case.<br /> It was officially stated recently that &quot;The Hedge,&quot; for example, would be the final publication for Changeling. This, I believe, is indicative of everything else.<br /> The &quot;Tome of the Pentacle&quot; also seems to be the last publication for Mage. <br /> As far as I can see, nothing else was officially announced, so it is safe to say that only Deviant will get one more book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28392-henlikuoth","name":"Henlikuoth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-28T10:51:12-07:00","id":1533321,"title":"","content":"That's the thing, not